    "encrypted": "false",
    "long_instructions": "## Create a Bar Chart\r\n\r\nThe `gas_prices_by_city.csv` dataset has been imported as `chart_two_data`. Ask AI Tutor to help you build a bar chart comparing gas prices across cities.\r\n\r\nYour chart should:\r\n\r\n- Use `City` for the x-axis and `Price` for the y-axis.\r\n- Include a meaningful title and axis labels.\r\n- Display readable city names.\r\n\r\nRun the program and check that both charts display correctly.",
    "ai_tutor_available": "false",
